  <ProfessionalSummary>覆盖中央冷却系统海水侧自动反冲洗功能、热带海域适应性及减少人工清洗频次的要求。</ProfessionalSummary>
  <EngineeringRequirements count="3">
    <Requirement id="ER-P056-01" level="1" requirementType="function">
      <sysml:Name>海水侧自动反冲洗功能</sysml:Name>
      <sysml:Text>中央冷却系统海水侧应配置自动反冲洗过滤器，该过滤器应能根据压差信号自动启动反冲洗程序，无需停机即可在线清洗。</sysml:Text>
      <sysml:VerifiedBy method="commissioning_check" />
      <sysml:DerivedFrom refId="ER-P056" />
      <sysml:Traceability>
        <Evidence id="E-SUPP-FILT-002" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-SUPP-FILT-001" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
      </sysml:Traceability>
      <sysml:QualityStatus>
        <SupportStatus>verified_by_direct_evidence</SupportStatus>
        <RiskIfUnmet>无自动反冲洗功能将导致生物附着堵塞，增加人工清洗频次，影响冷却效率。</RiskIfUnmet>
      </sysml:QualityStatus>
      <sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
        <Criterion>检查过滤器选型文件，确认具备自动反冲洗功能及压差信号触发机制。</Criterion>
        <Criterion>调试期间模拟压差信号，确认反冲洗程序自动启动，具体压差设定值按主机厂家 Technical Data 确认。</Criterion>
      </sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
      <sysml:EngineeringRationale>本条覆盖方面【海水侧自动反冲洗功能】，来自原始需求「海水侧自动反冲洗功能」。E-SUPP-FILT-002（CCS规则）支撑了热带航区宜配自动反冲洗；E-SUPP-FILT-001（DNV规则）支撑了自动反冲洗型须能按压差信号自动启动。</sysml:EngineeringRationale>
      <sysml:QualityGateReport passed="true" score="1.0">
        <Check dimension="evidence_sufficiency" passed="true" severity="error">
          <Message>Evidence present: 2 item(s), support_status='verified_by_direct_evidence'.</Message>
        </Check>
        <Check dimension="verifiability" passed="true" severity="error">
          <Message>Verifiable: method='commissioning_check', 2 criterion/criteria defined.</Message>
        </Check>
        <Check dimension="over_inference" passed="true" severity="error">
          <Message>No over-inference detected.</Message>
        </Check>
        <Check dimension="ambiguity" passed="true" severity="warning">
          <Message>No ambiguous terms detected (LLM check).</Message>
        </Check>
        <Check dimension="mbse_completeness" passed="true" severity="error">
          <Message>All 4 SysML required fields are present.</Message>
        </Check>
      </sysml:QualityGateReport>
    </Requirement>
    <Requirement id="ER-P056-02" level="1" requirementType="capacity">
      <sysml:Name>热带海域适应性</sysml:Name>
      <sysml:Text>中央冷却系统应能在热带海域最高海水温度35°C条件下保持正常工作，所有冷却设备容量应基于该温度进行设计。</sysml:Text>
      <sysml:VerifiedBy method="calculation" />
      <sysml:DerivedFrom refId="ER-P056" />
      <sysml:Traceability>
        <Evidence id="E-LT-CAP-001" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-CCS-COOL-001" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-IACS-M3-003" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
      </sysml:Traceability>
      <sysml:QualityStatus>
        <SupportStatus>verified_by_direct_evidence</SupportStatus>
        <RiskIfUnmet>热带海域冷却能力不足将导致主机超温，影响航行安全。</RiskIfUnmet>
      </sysml:QualityStatus>
      <sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
        <Criterion>审查热平衡计算书，确认冷却器、泵等设备容量按海水温度35°C选型。</Criterion>
        <Criterion>调试期间在模拟最高海水温度工况下验证系统冷却能力，具体试验工况按项目调试大纲确认。</Criterion>
      </sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
      <sysml:EngineeringRationale>本条覆盖方面【热带海域适应性】，来自原始需求「应对热带海域生物附着问题」。E-LT-CAP-001（DNV规则）要求热带设计海水温度≥35°C；E-CCS-COOL-001（CCS规则）要求系统按热带35°C设计；E-IACS-M3-003（IACS UR M3.1）要求按最高海水温度计算容量。</sysml:EngineeringRationale>
      <sysml:QualityGateReport passed="true" score="1.0">
