    <Requirement id="ER-P056-03" level="1" requirementType="maintainability">
      <sysml:Name>减少人工清洗频次</sysml:Name>
      <sysml:Text>自动反冲洗过滤器应设计为在正常航行条件下，人工清洗间隔不少于按主机厂家 Technical Data 确认的周期，以降低维护工作量。</sysml:Text>
      <sysml:VerifiedBy method="operation_check" />
      <sysml:DerivedFrom refId="ER-P056" />
      <sysml:Traceability>
        <Evidence id="E-SUPP-FILT-002" supportStatus="supported_by_indirect_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-SUPP-FILT-001" supportStatus="supported_by_indirect_evidence" />
      </sysml:Traceability>
      <sysml:QualityStatus>
        <SupportStatus>supported_by_indirect_evidence</SupportStatus>
        <RiskIfUnmet>人工清洗频次过高将增加船员劳动强度，偏离原始需求。</RiskIfUnmet>
      </sysml:QualityStatus>
      <sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
        <Criterion>审查过滤器技术资料，确认自动反冲洗周期满足厂家推荐值。</Criterion>
        <Criterion>运行期间记录反冲洗次数和人工清洗间隔，验证是否达到预期减少频次的目标。</Criterion>
      </sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
      <sysml:EngineeringRationale>本条覆盖方面【减少人工清洗频次】，来自原始需求「减少人工清洗频次」。E-SUPP-FILT-002（CCS规则）和E-SUPP-FILT-001（DNV规则）支撑了自动反冲洗功能可减少人工清洗，但未给出具体周期。</sysml:EngineeringRationale>
